<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds end at highs but lag Bunds.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds end at highs but lag Bunds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonds closed at record highs but lose ground on Bunds as Europe rises on European Union approval of Italy's financial plan. Low yields blocking new investors, traders say.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures up 22 at 110.95 vs Friday close *Feb 07 cash (OTC) 102.35 vs 102.15. Yld 6.29 vs 6.31 *Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 74 bps vs 71</p>
